  Loader2, Calendar, MapPin, ShoppingBag, Users, 
  Info, Camera, Mail, Trophy, ArrowRight, ChevronRight, Edit, Trash, Plus, Save, Copy, Check,
  LogIn, UserPlus, Upload, Image as ImageIcon, Settings, Phone, Home, Layout, FileText,
